(function(){var l=document.createElement('link');l.rel='stylesheet';l.href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap';document.head.appendChild(l);document.body.insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',"<header class=\"topbar\">\n<button class=\"brand\" id=\"brand\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"回到首页\">\n<span class=\"brand-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n<span class=\"brand-mark\">一物千景</span>\n<span class=\"brand-sub\">AI 场景种草策展台</span>\n</button>\n<ol class=\"steps\" aria-label=\"步骤\">\n<li><button type=\"button\" id=\"step-home\" data-go=\"home\"><span class=\"n\">01</span><span class=\"t\">输入商品</span></button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" id=\"step-market\" data-go=\"market\" disabled><span class=\"n\">02</span><span class=\"t\">品类档案</span></button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" id=\"step-map\" data-go=\"map\" disabled><span class=\"n\">03</span><span class=\"t\">场景星图</span></button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" id=\"step-plan\" data-go=\"plan\" disabled><span class=\"n\">04</span><span class=\"t\">策展清单</span></button></li>\n</ol>\n</header>\n<main>\n<section class=\"view\" id=\"view-home\">\n<div class=\"hero\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">给小红书中小商家的选题工具</p>\n<h1>一物<span class=\"dot\">·</span>千景</h1>\n<p class=\"lede\">先看清市场，再找到被需要的瞬间。</p>\n<p class=\"body\">输入一件商品：先看它所在品类的市场规模、竞品和细分价格带，再把它拆成“具体的人 × 具体的瞬间”，在星图上找到需求高、还没被写烂的场景，排成一周的笔记策划。</p>\n<div class=\"legend\">\n<span class=\"src src-org\">机构数据</span><span class=\"muted\">附原文链接</span>\n<span class=\"src src-jd\">京东实采</span><span class=\"muted\">真实 SKU 标价</span>\n<span class=\"src src-ai\">AI 评估</span><span class=\"muted\">判断，不是统计</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<form class=\"card form-card\" id=\"product-form\" novalidate>\n<h2>拆解你的商品</h2>\n<div class=\"field\">\n<label for=\"f-name\">商品名称</label>\n<input id=\"f-name\" name=\"name\" maxlength=\"20\" placeholder=\"例如：手冲咖啡壶\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n<label for=\"f-point\">一句话卖点</label>\n<input id=\"f-point\" name=\"point\" maxlength=\"40\" placeholder=\"例如：细口出水，新手也能控流\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"field-row\">\n<div class=\"field\">\n<label for=\"f-price\">你的定价（元）</label>\n<input id=\"f-price\" name=\"price\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"99999\" placeholder=\"例如：129\">\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\" id=\"f-submit\">开始拆解</button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"form-error\" id=\"f-error\" hidden>请先填写商品名称。</p>\n</form>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<h2>从一个示例开始</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">示例品类已接入机构数据和京东实采价格</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"samples\" id=\"samples\"></div>\n<div class=\"method\">\n<div><span class=\"k\">01</span><h3>输入商品</h3><p>名称、卖点和你的定价。</p></div>\n<div><span class=\"k\">02</span><h3>品类档案</h3><p>市场规模、竞品品牌、细分类型和价格带，看清你站在哪。</p></div>\n<div><span class=\"k\">03</span><h3>场景星图</h3><p>需求 × 拥挤度，按兴趣圈层和年龄段筛出机会场景。</p></div>\n<div><span class=\"k\">04</span><h3>策展清单</h3><p>挑出场景，自动排成周一到周六的发布计划。</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"view\" id=\"view-market\" hidden>\n<div class=\"page-head\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"crumbs\" id=\"m-crumbs\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"m-title\"></h1>\n<p class=\"tagline\" id=\"m-tagline\"></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"readout\" id=\"m-readout\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"m-root\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"view\" id=\"view-map\" hidden>\n<div class=\"page-head\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"crumbs\" id=\"map-crumbs\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"map-title\"></h1>\n<p class=\"tagline\" id=\"map-tagline\"></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"readout\" id=\"readout\"></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"notice\"><span class=\"src src-ai\">AI 评估</span>需求强度、内容拥挤度、人群规模和年龄段都是对每个场景的判断，用来排序和比较，不是统计数据。<span id=\"custom-notice\" hidden>当前商品不在示例中，场景由场景库组合生成，可作为策划起点。</span></p>\n<div class=\"toolbar\">\n<div class=\"chips\" id=\"circle-chips\" aria-label=\"按兴趣圈层筛选\"></div>\n<div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"视图\">\n<button type=\"button\" id=\"mode-chart\" aria-pressed=\"true\">星图</button>\n<button type=\"button\" id=\"mode-list\" aria-pressed=\"false\">列表</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"toolbar\">\n<div class=\"chips\" id=\"age-chips\" aria-label=\"按年龄段筛选\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"chart-wrap\" id=\"chart-wrap\">\n<svg id=\"chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 600\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"场景星图：横轴需求强度，纵轴内容拥挤度\"></svg>\n<div class=\"tooltip\" id=\"tooltip\" hidden></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"scene-list\" id=\"scene-list\" hidden></div>\n<div class=\"legend-note\">\n<span>● 越大，人群越多</span>\n<span>同色虚线连接同一兴趣圈层</span>\n<span>粉色区域为机会区：需求 ≥ 55 且拥挤度 ≤ 45</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"view\" id=\"view-plan\" hidden>\n<div class=\"plan-actions\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-sm\" type=\"button\" id=\"plan-back\">← 回到星图继续挑选</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" type=\"button\" id=\"plan-copy\">复制全部文案</button>\n</div>\n<div id=\"plan-root\"></div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"site-foot\">机构数据均附原文链接；京东价格为 2026-10-10 搜索页实采；场景分数为 AI 评估。 · 一物千景 Demo</footer>\n</main>\n<div class=\"tray\" id=\"tray\" hidden>\n<div class=\"picked\" id=\"tray-picked\"></div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"button\" id=\"tray-go\">生成本周策划</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"scrim\" id=\"scrim\"></div>\n<aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"d-title\" role=\"dialog\">\n<div class=\"drawer-head\">\n<span class=\"cat\" id=\"d-cat\"></span>\n<button class=\"icon-btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"d-close\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"drawer-body\" id=\"d-body\"></div>\n<div class=\"drawer-foot\">\n<button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"d-prev\">上一个</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"button\" id=\"d-pick\">加入策展清单</button>\n<button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"d-next\">下一个</button>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"loading\" id=\"loading\" hidden>\n<div class=\"loading-inner\">\n<div class=\"orbit\"></div>\n<p class=\"line\">正在读取品类数据…</p>\n<p class=\"line\">正在拆解人群与瞬间…</p>\n<p class=\"line\">正在评估内容拥挤度…</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>");})();
